      "title": "Job Opportunities",
      "description": "Job Opportunities - Helena College src=\"https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=2418329374980156&ev=PageView&noscript=1\" /> (406) 447-6900 admissions@helenacollege.edu Search Search Search Report an Incident Staff/Faculty Directory Portals Student Portal Employee Portal MENU Toggle navigation Events Explore Programs View All Programs Community Education Course Catalog eLearning Class Schedule Schedule a Visit Admissions Paying For College Financial Aid Tuition & Fees Net Price Calculator Scholarships Work-study Positions Registration & Transcripts Apply Now Job Opportunities Helena College > Human Resources > Job Opportunities We are currently experiencing issues with incoming phone calls. If you are unable to reach us by phone, please consult our directory and contact us by email Human Resources Home Annual Security Report Employment Opportunities Forms Institution Organizational Charts Professional Development Campus Safety Grant Time & Effort Resources ADA GrizPortal EEOC MFPE Helena Teachers' Union CBA Labor Law Local 400 CBA Montana Crisis Recovery Montana Human Rights Bureau Montana Public Employee Retirement Administration MUS Choices Benefits MUS Choices Workbook MUS Pension and Retirement MUS Retirement Plans Office for Civil Rights (OCR) Policies Preference (39.29 MCA) Procedures Floating Holiday Procedure NEOED Learn Required Training Teachers' Retirement System USERRA Veterans Public Employment MUS Wellness Programs MUS Workers Comp Helena College is seeking qualified applicants for the following positions: Adjunct Aviation Maintenance Adjunct Instructor Contract Professional Openings Faculty Openings Staff Openings Academic and Career Support Coordinator Accessibility Services Coordinator and Advisor Student Accounts Custodian II Temporary Tutor Temporary Commercial Driver's License Instructor (If another vacancy occurs in the same job title within six months, the same applicant pool may be used for the selection.) Helena College is an Employer of National Service. AmeriCorps, Peace Corps and other national service alumni are encouraged to apply for our positions. Mary Twardos Human Resources Generalist mary.twardos@helenacollege.edu (406) 447-6925 Alumni Bookstore Class Schedule Contact Us Course Catalog Employment Library Learning Hub Student Forms Campus Safety Testing Center Transcript Request Montana Motorcycle Rider Safety Accessibility Policies Councils & Committees Consumer Info Educational Partners HC-At-a-Glance Campus Safety © Helena College University of Montana | Privacy Policy About About Accreditation Alumni Campus & Facilities Helena College at a Glance HC Foundation Institutional Research State Authorization & Licensure Disclosure Why Helena College Academics Academic Advising Academic Calendar Academic Programs of Study Community Education Dean's List eLearning Educational Partners Library Tutoring Student Life ASHC & Student Clubs Wellness & Mental Health Student Resources Advising Campus Store Career Services Accessibility Services Financial Aid Paying your bill Student Handbook TRIO Veterans Benefits Campus Safety Campus Safety"
